            "format": "text/html",
            "value": "",
            "frametrail:name": "The launch site",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "title": "The launch site",
                "text": "&lt;p&gt;Farmland near Pervomaiskyi. The team says the evidence shows this “without any doubt”.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prosecutionservice.nl/topics/mh17-plane-crash/criminal-investigation-jit-mh17/jit-presentation-first-results-mh17-criminal-investigation-28-9-2016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;The team&amp;#x27;s presentation of 28 September 2016 ↗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
            }
        }
    },
